#!c=1
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TechInc Mesh BBS -- main menu (index.mu)
#
# A small read-only "BBS" for a Meshpoint NomadNet node: a splash screen and
# a menu of linked pages. Copy every .mu in this folder into your node's
# pages dir (data/reticulum/pages/), or paste them one at a time via the
# Reticulum page's Pages tab. Edit the [EDIT] lines for your own space.
#
# Every link is  :/page/<name>.mu  -- "this node, that page". Nothing here
# is executable, so it's a browse-only board: "leave a message" = reply
# over LXMF.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

